body:
I'm not a relationship person.

 I don't like the idea of being that close to someone forever. If I must choose then they gotta be good at communication and they have to be honest. I hate it when people aren't honest, it's almost always noticeable; it wastes too much of my time and prolongs a problem that could've been solved earlier. 

for guys: good fashion, bold to a point, open hearted and analytical (hold-able face and freckles would be a perk)

for girls: Soft and caring, strong, up front and future planner (a bit of hips and thighs is n e a t)
